    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebuild? how? i've missed the window for the funding, the conference deadlines are gone, and the truth is i'm not nearly as smart as they think i am. i've spent my whole adult life on this one thing and now it's just... zero. there's no pivot from this. it feels like every path i had just hit a wall. i don't see any version of the future where i'm not just a walking embarrassment. it's like the person i was supposed to be died with those files.",
