      "content": "it just feels so hollow though. like you're saying i can just \"learn new skills\" or whatever, but it feels insulting to pretend that it's easy to just start over from nothing when everything i've worked for is gone. the version of me that mattered is gone. i feel like i'm just carrying around a shell of a person now. what's the point of just \"being a person\" if there's no purpose or achievement behind it? everything feels so empty.",
